          "returnType": "void",
          "description": "Commit a new geometry. Resizes the backing store, writes the CSS box where one is requested, moves the application's logical coordinate system and dispatches Application.onResize. A commit whose logical or render size is not positive is ignored, so a policy may forward a zero-sized host measurement unconditionally."
        },
